</div>
</div>
<div class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-4xl flex-col gap-6 px-4 pt-6 pb-24 sm:gap-8 sm:pt-8 sm:pb-16">
<section aria-labelledby="home-headline" class="pt-4 pb-2 text-center sm:pt-8">
<p class="m-0 mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-300">Aave V3 health factor alerts</p>
<h1 id="home-headline" class="m-0 mb-4 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight sm:text-5xl bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral via-indigo-800 to-indigo-600 bg-clip-text text-transparent dark:from-white dark:via-purple-200 dark:to-indigo-300">Aave health factor alerts on Signal and email</h1>
<p class="mx-auto mt-0 mb-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-base-content/90 sm:text-lg dark:text-gray-200">Read-only: no approvals on your Aave position and no minimum size. We check every 5 minutes and alert you by Signal or email whenever your health factor is below the line you set.</p>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
<a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg rounded-full gap-2 px-8" href="/aave">Open the free dashboard<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="h-5 w-5">
<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3">
</path>
</svg>
</a>
<p class="m-0 max-w-md text-center text-sm text-base-content/70 dark:text-gray-400">Connect a wallet to see your Aave V3 health factor on 7 networks. Viewing is read-only.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 flex flex-col items-center gap-3">
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2">
<span class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80 dark:text-gray-300">Networks:</span>
