</li>
<li class="m-0 p-0">
<span class="badge badge-outline badge-md border-base-content/30 text-base-content dark:border-white/30">Polygon</span>
</li>
<li class="m-0 p-0">
<span class="badge badge-outline badge-md border-base-content/30 text-base-content dark:border-white/30">Arbitrum</span>
</li>
