</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2">
<span class="text-sm font-medium text-base-content/80 dark:text-gray-300">Alerts by:</span>
<ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 p-0">
<li class="m-0 p-0">
<span class="badge badge-outline badge-md border-base-content/30 text-base-content dark:border-white/30">Signal</span>
</li>
<li class="m-0 p-0">
<span class="badge badge-outline badge-md border-base-content/30 text-base-content dark:border-white/30">Email</span>
</li>
</ul>
